// Eight-column attention ingress and phase completion.
// The first query receiver acquires dense storage; later queries, keys,
// sequence identities, and values own distinct memory-tile descriptors.
// Continuation transfers queue their receiver before replacing shim source
// geometry. Completion waits protect that ordering and the reusable buffers.
target.decl @qwen3_embedding.panels.configuration

